# The raw Natural Earth download. ne_50m_coastline is ~1.6 MB of GeoJSON at
# six decimal places, and DESIGN.md's rule is that it never ships -- the build
# step rounds it to 2dp (~261 KB gzipped) and commits that instead. Regenerable,
# and Natural Earth changes rarely enough that pinning a copy buys nothing.
data/raw/

__pycache__/
.DS_Store
